[{:db/id "a757570a-5b0a-50a9-bc98-ac563d9d1ce7" :answer/id #uuid "a757570a-5b0a-50a9-bc98-ac563d9d1ce7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5dab8531-5053-5b1b-960d-22107ac03ca2" :answer/id #uuid "5dab8531-5053-5b1b-960d-22107ac03ca2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=D + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e3ca0a9f-4c7c-5392-b936-b70a824ebe7f" :answer/id #uuid "e3ca0a9f-4c7c-5392-b936-b70a824ebe7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "24f127e6-1306-5a2b-a3d3-e1cfe2de5c37" :answer/id #uuid "24f127e6-1306-5a2b-a3d3-e1cfe2de5c37" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ed1b0f73-2efc-5389-b2ce-f608d80d53f7" :answer/id #uuid "ed1b0f73-2efc-5389-b2ce-f608d80d53f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ddb49e73-0d27-5a15-86c6-4ce6a587bf67" :answer-field/id #uuid "ddb49e73-0d27-5a15-86c6-4ce6a587bf67" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["a757570a-5b0a-50a9-bc98-ac563d9d1ce7" "5dab8531-5053-5b1b-960d-22107ac03ca2" "e3ca0a9f-4c7c-5392-b936-b70a824ebe7f" "24f127e6-1306-5a2b-a3d3-e1cfe2de5c37" "ed1b0f73-2efc-5389-b2ce-f608d80d53f7"] :answer-field/correct "a757570a-5b0a-50a9-bc98-ac563d9d1ce7" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "035ced66-4ab9-5d2d-a65a-0b6c4095543d" :question/id #uuid "035ced66-4ab9-5d2d-a65a-0b6c4095543d" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((6)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((6)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =((-12)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-12)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["ddb49e73-0d27-5a15-86c6-4ce6a587bf67"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "47d92b48-ec79-52ab-a285-33d507f81dd6" :answer/id #uuid "47d92b48-ec79-52ab-a285-33d507f81dd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "be37962b-6efd-515c-a571-a13f146db634" :answer/id #uuid "be37962b-6efd-515c-a571-a13f146db634" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8a313bb8-d9a1-533b-b56d-8892fa941211" :answer/id #uuid "8a313bb8-d9a1-533b-b56d-8892fa941211" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7b45ba37-d4e1-534a-a901-557a1c17a7d6" :answer/id #uuid "7b45ba37-d4e1-534a-a901-557a1c17a7d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "eaa554b3-4a68-5807-bb3b-0cf90a40cca0" :answer/id #uuid "eaa554b3-4a68-5807-bb3b-0cf90a40cca0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "477df44a-11a1-5101-aade-bfbe97b75816" :answer-field/id #uuid "477df44a-11a1-5101-aade-bfbe97b75816" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["47d92b48-ec79-52ab-a285-33d507f81dd6" "be37962b-6efd-515c-a571-a13f146db634" "8a313bb8-d9a1-533b-b56d-8892fa941211" "7b45ba37-d4e1-534a-a901-557a1c17a7d6" "eaa554b3-4a68-5807-bb3b-0cf90a40cca0"] :answer-field/correct "47d92b48-ec79-52ab-a285-33d507f81dd6" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "76795e9c-6c55-5ca7-a4fc-d6d343e2c852" :question/id #uuid "76795e9c-6c55-5ca7-a4fc-d6d343e2c852" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- e^{- 2 x}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-1)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-1)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =((\\frac{1}{2})\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =((\\frac{1}{2})\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["477df44a-11a1-5101-aade-bfbe97b75816"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "706eaced-8e8c-52e2-bfea-e59cc1590246" :answer/id #uuid "706eaced-8e8c-52e2-bfea-e59cc1590246" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d82f188a-2305-57a9-8ca5-cb043c85d10d" :answer/id #uuid "d82f188a-2305-57a9-8ca5-cb043c85d10d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "52effbc3-75dd-51c0-8b3c-224c3cd54fd3" :answer/id #uuid "52effbc3-75dd-51c0-8b3c-224c3cd54fd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "96fe4e2b-4cff-525b-8ad1-4de8638750aa" :answer/id #uuid "96fe4e2b-4cff-525b-8ad1-4de8638750aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "16c97bc6-f60d-54c4-b7a0-0109b8b665a3" :answer/id #uuid "16c97bc6-f60d-54c4-b7a0-0109b8b665a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e387b32c-b692-5d4f-ab95-49c805f1cfd0" :answer-field/id #uuid "e387b32c-b692-5d4f-ab95-49c805f1cfd0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["706eaced-8e8c-52e2-bfea-e59cc1590246" "d82f188a-2305-57a9-8ca5-cb043c85d10d" "52effbc3-75dd-51c0-8b3c-224c3cd54fd3" "96fe4e2b-4cff-525b-8ad1-4de8638750aa" "16c97bc6-f60d-54c4-b7a0-0109b8b665a3"] :answer-field/correct "706eaced-8e8c-52e2-bfea-e59cc1590246" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "adfc6c39-9c84-5054-86dc-08ce214860eb" :question/id #uuid "adfc6c39-9c84-5054-86dc-08ce214860eb" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n4\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=24 x^{3} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=6 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(6 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((6)\\int \\left(x^{3}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((6)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-2)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((6)\\left(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right)) + ((6)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)) + ((-2)\\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =((\\frac{3}{2})\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-12)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((4)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =((\\frac{3}{2})\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + ((-12)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)) + ((4)\\left(2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["e387b32c-b692-5d4f-ab95-49c805f1cfd0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "9d88d181-065b-5b99-9c3d-def935f9acf7" :answer/id #uuid "9d88d181-065b-5b99-9c3d-def935f9acf7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "98d9400f-9d5a-5d32-9ef8-18683c25276d" :answer/id #uuid "98d9400f-9d5a-5d32-9ef8-18683c25276d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3a018671-33dd-5e1e-a486-47ea10f91d83" :answer/id #uuid "3a018671-33dd-5e1e-a486-47ea10f91d83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ab12cfcf-d837-5893-98cc-7bf52f85922b" :answer/id #uuid "ab12cfcf-d837-5893-98cc-7bf52f85922b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{x^{3}}{6} + \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} + 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "96e035ed-98be-559e-afe9-4fdf3c466757" :answer/id #uuid "96e035ed-98be-559e-afe9-4fdf3c466757" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c862d365-4036-51de-9a7d-af7d82638b2d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c862d365-4036-51de-9a7d-af7d82638b2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["9d88d181-065b-5b99-9c3d-def935f9acf7" "98d9400f-9d5a-5d32-9ef8-18683c25276d" "3a018671-33dd-5e1e-a486-47ea10f91d83" "ab12cfcf-d837-5893-98cc-7bf52f85922b" "96e035ed-98be-559e-afe9-4fdf3c466757"] :answer-field/correct "9d88d181-065b-5b99-9c3d-def935f9acf7" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "64d2112b-6455-564b-a00e-e1e0242afaf1" :question/id #uuid "64d2112b-6455-564b-a00e-e1e0242afaf1" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 2 x + 14 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 16 e^{- 2 x}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- x + 7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 8 e^{- 2 x}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- x + 7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 8 e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-1)\\int \\left(x\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-8)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((7)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-1)\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right)) + ((-8)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)) + ((7)\\left(\\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =((- \\frac{1}{2})\\int \\left(x^{2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((4)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((\\frac{7}{2})\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =((- \\frac{1}{2})\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right)) + ((4)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)) + ((\\frac{7}{2})\\left(- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["c862d365-4036-51de-9a7d-af7d82638b2d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "8922d260-2923-5acd-b341-65d16531156a" :answer/id #uuid "8922d260-2923-5acd-b341-65d16531156a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "49e876e9-eec7-5526-ad6f-32142b42b519